sequenceDiagram
    title Single sign-on login
    autonumber
    box Aqua Browser
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web
    end
    box rgb(240,240,255) Server
    participant A as API
    participant IdP as Identity provider
    participant DB@{ "type" : "database" }
    end
    U->>W: Clicks «Sign in»
    W->>+A: GET /login
    A-->>-W: 302 to the IdP
    Note right of W: The browser follows the redirect
    W->>IdP: /authorize
    alt valid credentials
        IdP-->>W: code
        W->>A: /callback?code
        A->>IdP: exchanges the code
        IdP-->>A: id_token
        loop each profile field
            A->>A: validates claim
        end
        A->>DB: upsert user
        A-->>W: session cookie
    else invalid credentials
        IdP--xW: error
    end
    W-)U: shows the dashboard
    link A: Dashboard @ https://example.com/api
